meta {
  name: Set password (Google users)
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/me/password/set
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "new_password": "BrandNewPass123!"
  }
}

docs {
  Set an initial password on an account that has none (a Google-only signup). Afterwards the account can log in with either Google or email/password. No current password required. Returns 409 password_already_set if a password already exists — that case must use PUT /me/password. Check `has_password` on GET /me to decide which form to show.
}
